        ],
        "text": "(Mill owner's room.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "(To Paranthaman.) I will not arrange a marriage against Usha's wishes.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "They say a woman's judgement comes afterwards. In this one matter, women must act according to their parents' opinion.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "And her parents' wish is to give her in marriage to another bridegroom......",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "Then it can't be done. Is that it? Hmm........",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "What kind of question is that, man! Very nice......",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'm telling you for the last time: give Usha to me and all is well; otherwise you'll have a major revolution to deal with.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "What are you trying to frighten me with?......",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "This time you cannot fool Paranthaman by giving him money!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "முதலாளி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s065-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "You want me to give you my daughter and be the one who's fooled? Impossible! Do whatever you want—go!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s065-u011",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 82,
            "printedPage": 74
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Paranthaman leaves angrily.)",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
